+From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
+From: Chase Fleming <ckfleming@gmail.com>
+Date: Sat, 7 Nov 2026 12:00:00 -0600
+Subject: [PATCH] Character creation: Human is the only race (Shattered Legacy
+ cc-P817)
+
+Chase, 2026-11-07: "I still want Gargoyle and Elf removed from selection page". The appearance screen adds only the
+Human race button; Human was already the default selection. The server makes any other race Human anyway.
